Required attribution string
---------------------------
This integration emits the following attribution on every entity (via
the standard `attribution` state attribute) and in every diagnostics
download:

    Datenquelle: LINZ AG LINIEN (data.linz.gv.at), CC BY 4.0

If you build a Lovelace card or any other user-facing UI on top of
this integration, please keep this attribution visible. The
contractual attribution string is defined as a single source of truth
in `custom_components/linz_linien_austria/const.py` (`ATTRIBUTION`)
and imported by `sensor.py`. The bundled Lovelace card displays it in
its footer.

